{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a lucid nightmare in <strong>R.E.M. Rage</strong>, a rogue-like beat 'em up where fast reflexes, wild combos, and creative movement are your only way out. You are a lone fighter caught in a twisted dream world \u2014 each run throws you into new challenges, bizarre environments, and relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain aerial attacks, master special moves (some oddly familiar...), and make use of parkour elements to control space and survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built in Unreal Engine 5, <i>R.E.M. Rage</i> blends arcade-style combat with modern rogue-like progression. No two runs are the same, and death is just the beginning of another fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Punch, jump, dodge, rage \u2014 wake up swinging.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845930?t=1753809720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845930?t=1753809720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845930/fab6ce215ba5ce860edec4fcb7fff3f3ba63a8f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753809720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845930/fab6ce215ba5ce860edec4fcb7fff3f3ba63a8f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753809720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3866350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a lucid nightmare in <strong>R.E.M. Rage</strong>, a rogue-like beat 'em up where fast reflexes, wild combos, and creative movement are your only way out. You are a lone fighter caught in a twisted dream world \u2014 each run throws you into new challenges, bizarre environments, and relentless enemies.